{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370170","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1037017001:1":{"text":"過ごしやすさで言えば、ここもなかなか悪くない。","source_cn":"这里还是很不错的，如果只考虑居住舒适度的话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3992FAF1D1F8380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037017002:1":{"text":"じゃが一人で住んでいると、情報に疎くなってしまうでな。","source_cn":"可是一个人住在这里，消息实在是不大灵通。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D9334C81DE0D2B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037017003:1":{"text":"通りがかった村人が教えてくれなかったら、いまだに汚染の真相を知らないままじゃった！","source_cn":"要不是路过的村民告诉我，我可能到现在还不知道污染的真相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA647DDB0747F6039","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037017004:1":{"text":"そう思うと、やはりみんなと一緒に暮らした方がいいかもしれんのう。","source_cn":"这么一想，还是和大家生活在一起比较好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D58163D7BB414A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:村民契尔曼":{"text":"村人のチェルマン","source":"村民契尔曼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}